3295 0 obj
  << /ActualText (People do not always say what they think\056\n\nSometimes we fear what others will think\056 Sometimes we fear being left outside the group\056 Sometimes we fear losing status\054 relationships\054 or safety\056 Sometimes we soften what we think\056 Sometimes we change it\056 Sometimes we stay silent\056\n\nAnd sometimes we hide the truth not only from others\054 but from ourselves\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
