3331 0 obj
  << /ActualText (None of us sees the whole\056\n\nEach person looks at the world from somewhere else\056 With different experiences\056 Different knowledge\056 Different fears\056 Different needs\056\n\nAnother view does not have to change our mind\056 Sometimes it only makes visible what we could not see\056 Asking for another view is not asking for approval\073 it is trying to notice what the decision may be missing\056\n\nThe goal is not for everyone to think the same thing\056 It is to see more clearly together\056)
