3403 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Komite is not a product to be completed\073 it is a problem network to be worked through\056\n\nIt was not created to declare the correct answer\056\n\nIts purpose is to help people express their thoughts as free from pressure as possible\054 see different perspectives more safely\054 and learn from the consequences of decisions\056 Expertise is preserved\056 Minority rights are preserved\056\n\nKomite does not know the truth\056 It does not decide\056 It helps people see more clearly\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
